Icon artwork
------------

The base icon shapes come from the "7000 FREE UI ICONS" Figma Community file
by Cristian Muñoz and are redistributed here with attribution. The glass and
duotone styles are derived from that artwork in this project.

If you redistribute the icons, in this repository's packages or in your own
work, keep this notice and the attribution to Cristian Muñoz with them.


Brand and payment logos
-----------------------

The icons in the "company-logos" category (shown as "Brands") and the payment
logos in public/payments are trademarks of their respective owners. They are
included so people can point to those products and show accepted payment
methods. This licence covers the files only; it grants no right to use the
marks themselves. Follow each owner's brand guidelines.
